      "path": "/projects/ngx-cdk-scroll-strategies/docs/advanced",
      "html": "<p data-line=\"0\" class=\"code-line\">Call this after <a href=\"/projects/ngx-cdk-scroll-strategies/docs/readme#installation\">Installation</a>.</p>\n<blockquote data-line=\"2\" class=\"code-line\">\n<p data-line=\"2\" class=\"code-line\">This is a practical demo. Make scroll items separate components and get a height for each component.<br>\nIt is difficult without basic knowledge of Angular.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul data-line=\"5\" class=\"code-line\">\n<li data-line=\"5\" class=\"code-line\">Demo: <a href=\"https://rdlabo-ionic-angular-library.netlify.app/main/scroll-strategies/advanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://rdlabo-ionic-angular-library.netlify.app/main/scroll-strategies/advanced</a></li>\n<li data-line=\"6\" class=\"code-line\">Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/rdlabo-dev/ionic-angular-library/tree/v21.7.0/projects/demo/src/app/scroll-strategies/pages/scroll-advanced\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/rdlabo-dev/ionic-angular-library/tree/v21.7.0/projects/demo/src/app/scroll-strategies/pages/scroll-advanced</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
